				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					7.17
				</span></i>
			; <i>bad for bad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμείψεται φόνον φόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					1093
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν κακῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.13
