        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			like
			
				Act.
			, <i>change</i> a place, <i>pass</i> either
			<i>out</i> or <i>in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ . . ἀμείψεται ἕρκος ὀδόντων</span>”
